# Line endings, decided by the repository instead of by whoever clones it.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) converts on checkout, so the same commit
# produces CRLF on one machine and LF on another -- and the working tree here had drifted into a mix
# (8 files CRLF, 59 LF) because some of the experiment material was captured through tools that write
# CRLF. One convention, stated once.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The stimuli are the evidence. Never touch their bytes.
*.png binary

# Windows-only files that must keep their own line endings if they are ever added.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
